Fetched product photography
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This plugin ships a manifest of Unsplash photo identifiers, not photographs.
The seed command downloads them from images.unsplash.com on first run and
imports them into the shop's own media library; no photograph is distributed
with this software.

Those photographs are provided under the Unsplash License
(https://unsplash.com/license), which grants an irrevocable, non-exclusive,
